cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Stellome, please cite it as below, together with STRING, Reactome and UniProt."
title: "Stellome: an interactive map of the human proteome"
abstract: >-
  Stellome is a self-contained interactive map of every human protein in STRING and their
  high-confidence interactions, grouped by Reactome top-level pathway, with pathway crosstalk
  analysis, edge bundling, data overlays and live links to UniProt, Open Targets and AlphaFold DB.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Dina
    family-names: Ahdab
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/stellome"
url: "https://USERNAME.github.io/stellome/"
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - protein-protein interactions
  - interactome
  - network visualization
  - STRING
  - Reactome
  - pathway crosstalk
  - bioinformatics
